ion":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-2e301539ebf8e423a434"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuhuan-q-2e301539ebf8e423a434","order":6151},{"id":"wuhuan-e-1856762df55f83f40b8f","title":"能臣氐等至桑干，议扶罗韩部威禁宽缓恐不见济，更遣人呼轲比能","accounts":[{"id":"wuhuan-a-1856762df55f83f40b8f","label":"正文","text":"能臣氐等至桑干，议扶罗韩部威禁宽缓恐不见济，更遣人呼轲比能","evidence":["wuhuan-q-6f90319fb9ef43b35ea8"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0245","role":"遣人改邀者","evidence":["wuhuan-q-6f90319fb9ef43b35ea8"]},{"person":"wendi-p0032","role":"被邀者","evidence":["wuhuan-q-6f90319fb9ef43b35ea8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-6f90319fb9ef43b35ea8"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuhuan-q-6f90319fb9ef43b35ea8","order":6152}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0245","name":"能臣抵之","evidence":["wudi-q-o114","wuhuan-q-4068c5fce2116fef8a9b","wuhuan-q-2e301539ebf8e423a434","wuhuan-q-6f90319fb9ef43b35ea8"],"facts":[{"id":"wudi-f-b-b5824a828ea5c51830d0-wudi-p0245-fe153f","label":"又作","text":"能臣氐","evidence":["wudi-q-b-b5824a828ea5c51830d0"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"能臣氐","evidence":["wudi-q-b-b5824a828ea5c51830d0"]},{"text":"能臣氐","evidence":["wuhuan-q-4068c5fce2116fef8a9b"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o114-wudi-p0245","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o114"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o114b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-450f7815dc8f8edb5b1d","layer":"original","quote":"未至二百里，虏乃知之。尚、熙与蹋顿、辽西单于楼班、右北平单于能臣抵之等〖10〗，将数万骑逆军。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":633,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":87,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-b5824a828ea5c51830d0","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b5824a828ea5c51830d0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗能臣抵之：据本书卷三十《乌丸传》，能臣抵之即能臣氐，是代郡乌丸首领。当时右北平乌丸的首领是乌延和汗卢。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":648,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f67c054fae9ed2369430","start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":621,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o114","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-450f7815dc8f8edb5b1d","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，大水，傍海道不通；田畴请为乡导〖3〗，公从之。引军出卢龙塞〖4〗，塞外道绝不通。乃堑山堙谷五百余里〖5〗，经白檀〖6〗，历平冈〖7〗；涉鲜卑庭〖8〗，东指柳城〖9〗。未至二百里，虏乃知之。尚、熙与蹋顿、辽西单于楼班、右北平单于能臣抵之等〖10〗，将数万骑逆军。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":633,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-2e301539ebf8e423a434","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-7a2407d2753b29e36a3a","layer":"original","quote":"扶罗韩将万余骑迎之","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":58,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-4068c5fce2116fef8a9b","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-7a2407d2753b29e36a3a","layer":"original","quote":"后代郡乌丸能臣氐等叛，求属扶罗韩","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-6f90319fb9ef43b35ea8","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-7a2407d2753b29e36a3a","layer":"original","quote":"到桑干〖3〗，氐等议，以为扶罗韩部威禁宽缓，恐不见济〖4〗；更遣人，呼轲比能","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":64,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
